# Commission & recruitment policy (required reading)

Before editing ambassador recruitment bonuses, SBD subscription commissions, payout UI, or recruiter code handling:

1. Read **`docs/COMMISSION-MASTER-PRINCIPLES.md`** first.
2. Recruitment (15,000 FCFA signup): **`docs/RECRUITMENT-BONUS-POLICY.md`** (`2026-03-v3`) — no Executive upline payouts.
3. SBD subscriptions: **`docs/SBD-SUBSCRIPTION-COMMISSION-POLICY.md`** — recurring 500+250+250 on 5,000 base.
4. Executive: **`docs/EXECUTIVE-NETWORK-DIRECTOR.md`** — replication only, no commission tier.
5. Implement recruitment via `functions/recruitment-bonus-policy.js` + `recruitment-bonus-service.js`.
6. After changes, run:
   - `node scripts/test-recruitment-bonus-policy.js`
   - `node scripts/verify-ambassador-register-flow.mjs`
7. Deploy: `firebase deploy --only functions` plus site deploy for public/admin JS.

Recruiter codes must use hyphen format (`AMB-KONI-8321`); normalize on client and server. Admin approval still gates activation.
